<div class="section section-low section-z-top " id="section-overview" >
    <span class=section-id id="overview"></span><div class="bg"></div>
    <section>
      <div class="row none">
    <div class="column_8 align-left">
                <h2 class="heading section_title ">Europe’s Third Biggest Exchange</h2>








<div  class="textimage ">
    <div class="">
                    <div><p>The global fund market keeps growing, as more and more assets are invested in ETFs and mutual funds. The Swiss Stock Exchange is an ideal distribution network for companies looking to tap into this growth potential. List your ETFs, ETPs and funds on our exchange and gain access to Switzerland’s highly capitalized international investor base.</p>
<p>The Swiss Stock Exchange supports you actively in bringing innovative products to our market with first-rate services and personal support from our experts. We have created an efficient and clearly structured listing process so that your ETFs, ETPs and funds can be launched successfully and traded quickly.</p></div></div>
        </div></div>
    <div class="column_4 align-left">
                <ul class="fa-ul linklist linklist-seamless" data-six-layout="linklist">
        <li class="linklist-title">Useful Links:</li>
          <li >
            <a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/contacts/listing/etf-funds.html">Contact</a></li>

        <li >
            <a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/newsroom.html">Newsroom</a></li>

        <li >
            <a href="https://www.ser-ag.com/en/topics/admission.html" target="_self">SIX Exchange Regulation</a></li>

        </ul></div>
    </div>

</section>
    </div>
<div class="section bg-light-gray section-low section-z-top " id="section-services" >
    <span class=section-id id="services"></span><div class="bg"></div>
    <section>
      












    <h6 class="heading description ">Service Package</h6>









    <h2 class="heading section_title ">Discover Our Services</h2>








<div class="page-list-subpages">
    <div class="list2 list-box list-image-top  list-horizontal-4-4-4 list-title-bigger " data-six-hide=".item" >

    <ul >
      <li class="item clearfix " data-six-item-id="/content/six/global/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/etfs-etps-and-funds/etfs"
    data-six-tags="/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/contacts/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing-general-inquiries/etfs-and-funds,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-topic/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/offering/the-swiss-stock-exchange/etfs,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-unit/the-swiss-stock-exchange,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/insights/client-advisory,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/insights/compliance" data-page-view-count="">
    <a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/etfs-etps-and-funds/etfs.html"><div class="cell">
    
    <h3 class="teaser-title">ETF Listing</h3>

<p>Listing an ETF? On SIX Swiss Exchange, product issuers benefit from a simple and efficient listing procedure. Within 10 trading days, your ETF can start trading. </p>
        <span class="teaser-link">Find Out More</span>
    </div></a></li>
<li class="item clearfix " data-six-item-id="/content/six/global/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/etfs-etps-and-funds/etps"
    data-six-tags="/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/offering/the-swiss-stock-exchange/etps,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-unit/the-swiss-stock-exchange,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/contacts/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing-general-inquiries/etps,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-topic/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/insights/client-advisory,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/insights/compliance" data-page-view-count="">
    <a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/etfs-etps-and-funds/etps.html"><div class="cell">
    
    <h3 class="teaser-title">ETPs</h3>

<p>Planning to issue and distribute ETPs? The Swiss Stock Exchange helps issuers launch innovative products and provides access to investors.</p>
        <span class="teaser-link">Find Out More</span>
    </div></a></li>
<li class="item clearfix " data-six-item-id="/content/six/global/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/etfs-etps-and-funds/mutual-funds"
    data-six-tags="/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/offering/the-swiss-stock-exchange/mutual-funds,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-unit/the-swiss-stock-exchange,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/contacts/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing-general-inquiries/etfs-and-funds,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/business-topic/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/insights/client-advisory,/content/cq:tags/sixReference/six/insights/compliance" data-page-view-count="">
    <a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/etfs-etps-and-funds/mutual-funds.html"><div class="cell">
    
    <h3 class="teaser-title">Mutual Funds</h3>

<p>Listing on the Swiss Stock Exchange is an effective route to growth. Read on to learn more about listing and admitting mutual funds.</p>
        <span class="teaser-link">Find Out More</span>
    </div></a></li>
</ul>

    </div>
</div>

</section>
    </div>
<div class="section section-z-top " id="section-book" >
    <span class=section-id id="book"></span><div class="bg"></div>
    <section>
      


<div class="spacer-v spacer-v--large "></div>






    <h2 class="heading section_title ">25 Years ETFs in Switzerland: Discover our Microsite</h2>








<div class="row none">
    <div class="column_4 ">
                <div  class="textimage ">
    <div class="figure ">
                <div class="fig image-block">
                        <figure>
            <a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/newsroom/news/the-swiss-stock-exchange/2021/fn-awards.html"><img data-six-img='{"source":{"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/the-swiss-stock-exchange/25y-etf-teaser.png","width":1000,"height":800},"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/the-swiss-stock-exchange/25y-etf-teaser.six-image.[FORMAT].[WIDTH].png","original":[80,160,240,510,720,1000]}'></a></figure></div>
                <div class="cell">
                        </div>
                </div>
        </div></div>
    <div class="column_8 ">
                <div  class="textimage ">
    <div class="">
                    <div><p><b>Celebrating a quarter century of partnership, growth and innovation, we invite you to look back with us at an unparalleled success story.</b></p>
<p>Our dedicated webpage features congratulations of our esteemed clients and partners, a look back on the milestones of ETFs in Switzerland, how the Swiss stock exchange contributed to the growth of the segment, client success stories as well as many reasons for the past and future success of ETFs.&nbsp;</p></div></div>
        </div>
<div class="row none">
    <div class="column_3 ">
                <div class="button_link">
    <!-- Use download attribute: -->
            <a class="btn btn-header-standard btn-normal btn-primary
                   btn-inline  " href="https://www.six-group.com/25yrs-etfs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="screenreader">Discover the Microsite</span></a></div></div>
    <div class="column_3 ">
                <div class="button_link">
    <!-- Use download attribute: -->
            <a class="btn btn-header-red btn-normal btn-primary
                   btn-inline  " href="https://www.six-group.com/en/newsroom/news/the-swiss-stock-exchange/2025/25-years-etf-anniversary.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="screenreader">Read our News</span></a></div></div>
    <div class="column_3  column--invisible">
                </div>
    <div class="column_3  column--invisible">
                </div>
    </div></div>
    </div>

</section>
    </div>
<div class="section section-z-top "  >
    <div class="bg"></div>
    <section>
      


<div class="spacer-v spacer-v--medium "></div>






    <h2 class="heading section_title ">Switzerland: A Leading Hub for Asset Management</h2>








<div class="row none">
    <div class="column_6 ">
                <div data-six-textimage="left" class="textimage ">
    <div class="">
                    <div><p>Switzerland is Europe’s premier asset management hub, with more than CHF 6 trillion worth of assets under management for both domestic and international clients. That figure is almost three times the size of Switzerland’s GDP. And, per capita, Swiss asset managers have the world’s largest portfolios .<br> <br> This success builds on the two strengths that characterize Switzerland:</p>
<ul>
 <li>First, Switzerland’s hard-earned reputation as a leading financial center and a hotbed of innovation.</li>
 <li>Second, Switzerland is one of the most attractive and competitive business locations in the world.<br></li>
</ul></div></div>
        </div></div>
    <div class="column_6 ">
                <div  class="textimage ">
    <div class="figure ">
                <div class="fig image-block">
                        <figure>
            <img data-six-img='{"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/the-swiss-stock-exchange/Header/GettyImages-1195615455.six-image.[FORMAT].[WIDTH].jpg","standard":[80,160,240,510,720,1020,1250,1920,2560]}'></figure></div>
                <div class="cell">
                        </div>
                </div>
        </div></div>
    </div>



<div class="spacer-v spacer-v--medium "></div>
</section>
    </div>
<div class="section sectoin-bg-img section-low section-z-bottom color-inverted " id="section-cta" >
    <span class=section-id id="cta"></span><div class="bg"></div>
    <section>
      <div class="row none">
    <div class="column_4 ">
                <h2 class="heading section_title ">ETF Market Report</h2></div>
    <div class="column_8 ">
                <h3 class="heading chapter_title ">Read our quarterly report on the performance and progress of the Swiss ETF market. Subscribe for free to never miss an issue.</h3>






<div class="button_link">
    <!-- Use download attribute: -->
            <a class="btn btn-header-standard btn-normal btn-primary
                   btn-inline  " href="https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/listing/etfs-etps-and-funds.html#etf-market-reports" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="screenreader">Subscribe Now</span></a></div></div>
    </div>

</section>
    <div class="section-img">
        <img class="js cover cover-y-top cover-x-center" data-six-img='{"source":{"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/market-data/id-bg-overlay.png","width":1420,"height":700},"path":"https://www.six-group.com/dam/images/market-data/id-bg-overlay.six-image.[FORMAT].[WIDTH].png","original":[80,160,240,510,720,1020,1250,1420]}'></div>
    </div>
<div class="section section-z-top "  >
    <div class="bg"></div>
    <section>
      


<div class="spacer-v spacer-v--medium "></div><div class="row featured featuredColumns">
    <div class="column_6 ">
                <h3 class="heading underlined_title ">A Safe and Regulated Environment</h3>






<div data-six-textimage="right" class="textimage ">
    <div class="">
                    <div><p>The Swiss Stock Exchange ensures efficient and liquid trading of your products. We operate not only one of the most technologically advanced, but also one of the most stable stock exchanges in the World. Which means investors are always able trade your ETFs, ETPs and funds listed on our exchange.</p></div></div>
        </div></div>
    <div class="column_6 ">
                <h3 class="heading underlined_title ">The Growth of ETF Trading</h3>






<div data-six-textimage="left" class="textimage ">
    <div class="">
                    <div><p>On the Swiss Stock Exchange, ETFs have written an unprecedentend success story. We’ve seen growth in every aspect: issuers, products and trading volumes. In 2019, we’ve seen a record trading turnover in ETFs of CHF 124.7 billion (+24.0%, year-on-year).&nbsp;</p></div></div>
        </div></div>
    </div>
<div data-six-textimage="right" class="textimage ">
    <div class="">
                    </div>
        </div>

</section>
    </div>
<div class="section section-z-top " id="section-resources" >
    <span class=section-id id="resources"></span><div class="bg"></div>
    <section>
      


<div class="spacer-v spacer-v--medium "></div>






    <h2 class="heading section_title ">Resources and Downloads</h2>













    





