<div  class="textimage ">
    <div class="">
                    <div><p>Our brochures and factsheets describe the advantages of trading Exchange Traded Funds (ETFs) and Exchange Traded Products (ETPs) as well as Sponsored Funds.</p></div></div>
        </div>
<script src="/etc.clientlibs/ihcc/components/list/taxonomy_list/clientlibs.min.ACSHASHb5432cf61b13cfe82dc392bc762076fc.js"></script>
<div class="" data-six-hide=".item,.fa-ul>li">
    <ul  class="link-list fa-ul link-list--with-file-icons link-list--with-file-exts" data-results-number-to-show="0">
        <li class="item taxonomy-list__item--type-link-list "
        data-six-item-id="/content/dam/six/download/the-swiss-stock-exchange/trading/markets/etfs/etf-brochure-en.pdf">
        <div class="teaser-path">
        <ul class="breadcrumbs teaser-breadcrumbs">
            <li>
                        <time datetime="2019-01-01">Jan 1, 2019</time>
                    </li>
                </ul>
    </div>
<a class="link-list__link link-list__link--with-file-ext" href="https://www.six-group.com/dam/download/the-swiss-stock-exchange/trading/markets/etfs/etf-brochure-en.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa-li fa fa-angle-right"></i><span>Exchange Traded Funds on the Swiss Stock Exchange</span></a></li>
<li class="item taxonomy-list__item--type-link-list "
        data-six-item-id="/content/dam/six/download/the-swiss-stock-exchange/trading/markets/etfs/etf-factsheet-en.pdf">
        <div class="teaser-path">
