<div  class="textimage ">
    <div class="">
                    <div><p>SIX publishes the ETF Market Report. The report provides detailed figures about the development of the ETF segment to investors, market participants and the interested public. It provides a broad insight in trading activity, trends and changes in the Swiss ETF market.&nbsp;Want to receive the&nbsp;ETF Market Report on a regular basis? Sign up&nbsp;<a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange/newsletter/exchange-news-and-reports.html">here</a>.</p></div></div>
        </div>
