<div  class="textimage ">
    <div class="">
                    <div><p>Published on a regular basis, the series of articles "Funds in Focus" will present different topical investment themes, including a list of Sponsored Funds that relate to the given theme. The team of authors consists of the fund specialists at Bank Julius Baer that handle the market making of traditional investment funds.</p></div></div>
        </div>
