<div  class="textimage ">
    <div class="">
                    <div><p>The Swiss Stock Exchange publishes the Crypto Products Report on a monthly basis as well as the yearly report once a year. The report provides detailed figures about the development of the crypto products as well as information on trading activity, trends and changes in this segment to investors, market participants and the interested public.&nbsp;Want to receive the Crypto Product Reports on a regular basis? Sign up&nbsp;<a href="https://www.six-group.com/en/services/newsletter/the-swiss-stock-exchange.html">here</a>.</p></div></div>
        </div>





    





